@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
title Comunicação - UC06 Atualizar Demanda

rectangle Usuario
rectangle Frontend
rectangle DemandController
rectangle DemandService
rectangle DemandRepository
rectangle DemandHistoryService
rectangle DemandAlertService
rectangle Queue

Usuario --> Frontend : 1: editarDemanda()
Frontend --> DemandController : 2: PUT /demands/{id}
DemandController --> DemandService : 3: atualizar(id, dados)

DemandService --> DemandRepository : 4: buscarPorId(id)
DemandRepository --> DemandService : 5: demandaEncontrada
DemandService --> DemandRepository : 6: persistirAlteracoes()
DemandRepository --> DemandService : 7: demandaAtualizada
DemandService --> DemandHistoryService : 8: registrarHistorico()
DemandHistoryService --> DemandService : 9: ok
DemandService --> DemandAlertService : 10: createDemandUpdatedAlerts()
DemandAlertService --> Queue : 11: dispatch job

DemandService --> DemandController : 12: sucesso()
DemandController --> Frontend : 13: respostaOK()
Frontend --> Usuario : 14: mostrarMensagem()
@enduml
